{"root":"lutut","ipa":"/lu.tut/","core":"人体解剖学名词，指连接大腿和小腿的关节部位，即膝盖。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/lu.tut/","zh":"膝盖，膝部","phrases":[{"t":"berlutut","zh":"跪下"},{"t":"lutut kaki","zh":"膝盖部位"},{"t":"sakit lutut","zh":"膝盖疼"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia jatuh hingga lututnya terluka.","zh":"他摔倒了，膝盖受了伤。"},{"t":"Anak itu duduk dengan lutut ditekuk.","zh":"那个孩子弯着膝盖坐着。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"lutut","ipa":"/lu.tut/","zh":"膝盖","phrase":{"t":"lutut lecet","zh":"膝盖擦伤"},"example":{"t":"Lututnya berdarah setelah terjatuh.","zh":"摔倒后他的膝盖流血了。"}},{"w":"berlutut","ipa":"/bər.lu.tut/","zh":"跪下，屈膝","phrase":{"t":"berlutut memohon","zh":"跪下恳求"},"example":{"t":"Mereka berlutut untuk berdoa.","zh":"他们跪下祈祷。"}},{"w":"melutut","ipa":"/mə.lu.tut/","zh":"用膝盖顶，跪着移动","phrase":{"t":"melutut di lantai","zh":"在地上跪行"},"example":{"t":"Dia melutut untuk mencari cincin yang hilang.","zh":"他跪在地上寻找丢失的戒指。"}}],"derSlugs":["lutut","berlutut","melutut"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:08:39.112Z","src":"base"}